helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156054				0	ko	Sub ExampleFormat				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148993				0	ko	MsgBox Format(6328.2, &quot;##,##0.00&quot;)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A2				0	ko	REM은 사용자가 Basic 원본 코드에 숫자를 입력할 때 항상 마침표를 소수 구분 기호로 사용합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147339				0	ko	REM displays for example 6,328.20 in English locale, 6.328,20 in German locale.				20200411 15:09:53
