helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149185				0	ko	DIM text$(5 to 25)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149690				0	ko	5에서 25까지 번호 매겨진 21개의 요소				20200411 15:09:53
