helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	ko	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:DBViewFunctions\"\> \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"쿼리 디자인\"\>쿼리 디자인\</link\> 창의 디자인 보기 아래쪽에 "함수" 행을 표시합니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149205				0	ko	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbviewfunctions.png\" id=\"img_id3154399\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154399\"\>아이콘\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
