helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176	91			0	ko	\<emph\>SQL 보기에서 쿼리 만들기\</emph\> 아이콘 \<image id=\"img_id3154071\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbnewquerysql.png\" width=\"0.1862in\" height=\"0.1862in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154071\"\>아이콘\</alt\>\</image\>을 클릭하십시오.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786	92			0	ko	목록에서 기존 쿼리를 선택하고 \<emph\>편집\</emph\> 아이콘 \<image id=\"img_id3156212\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbqueryedit.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156212\"\>아이콘\</alt\>\</image\>을 클릭합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443				0	ko	\<emph\>쿼리\</emph\> 창에서 \<emph\>보기 - 디자인 보기 전환/해제\</emph\>를 선택합니다. SQL 명령을 편집합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460	96			0	ko	Click the \<emph\>Run\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3152886\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sbaexecutesql.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152886\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. The result of the query is displayed in the upper window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3149298	98			0	ko	\<emph\>저장\</emph\> 또는 \<emph\>다른 이름으로 저장\</emph\> 아이콘 \<image id=\"img_id3153159\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_save.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153159\"\>아이콘\</alt\>\</image\>을 클릭하여 쿼리를 저장하십시오.				20200411 15:09:53
