helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200911011975				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Open icon presents a file open dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
