helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3145071				0	ko	In \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find options for your default language and currency setting.				20200411 15:09:53
