helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819	12			0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SVXDLG_BMPMASK:CBX_4\" visibility=\"visible\"\>해당 색상을 바꾸려면 이 필드를 선택하십시오.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
