helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\grid.xhp	0	help	par_id4372692				0	ko	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - 환경 설정\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>도구 - 옵션\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\"\>표시 형식\</link\>에서 그리드선 색상을 설정합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
