helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159221				0	ko	필드의 최고값을 산출합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146866				0	ko	최소				20200411 15:09:53
