helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157982				0	ko	필드의 최저값을 산출합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154828				0	ko	합계				20200411 15:09:53
