helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150330				0	ko	\<variable id=\"achsen\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertMenuAxes\"\>차트에 표시할 축을 지정합니다.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
