helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154255				0	ko	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05070000.xhp\" name=\"차트 밑면\"\>차트 밑면\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
