helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150207				0	ko	\<bookmark_value\>3D 회전 개체; 생성\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>3D 개체; 생성\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>3D 장면; 생성\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>변환; 곡선으로, 다각형, 3D\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>입체 면 개체\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
