helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147276				0	ko	HEX2BIN				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3150258				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_HEX2BIN\"\>입력한 16진수 값을 2진수로 계산하여 반환합니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
