helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163230				0	ko	LINEST를 참조하십시오. 단, 제곱 합이 구해지지 않습니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163286				0	ko	\<bookmark_value\>SUMPRODUCT 함수\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>스칼라 곱\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>도트 곱\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>내적 곱\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
