helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id8455153				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>ASC 함수가 전자를 반자 아스키 및 가타카나 문자로 변환합니다. 문자열을 반환합니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id9912411				0	ko	See \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Calc/Features/JIS_and_ASC_functions\"\>JIS and ASC Spreadsheet Functions\</link\> for a conversion table.				20200411 15:09:53
