helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3155757	16			0	ko	\<emph\>숫자1; 숫자2;...숫자30\</emph\>은 숫자값이거나 범위입니다. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153297				0	ko	예				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118	18			0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SKEW(A1:A50)\</item\>은 참조하는 데이터의 기울기 값을 계산합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149051				0	ko	\<bookmark_value\>회귀선; FORECAST 함수\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>보외\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>FORECAST 함수\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
