helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147005				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_COLROWNAMERANGES:BTN_ADD\"\>현재 레이블 범위를 목록에 추가합니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
