helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3157996				0	ko	NOT(논리값)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148766	16			0	ko	            \<emph\>논리값\</emph\>은 어떠한 값이라도 포함되어야 합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149884				0	ko	예				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150132	18			0	ko	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NOT(A)\</item\>은 수학에서의 역과 같습니다. A=TRUE(참)일 때 NOT(A)는 FALSE(거짓)로 평가됩니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394				0	ko	\<bookmark_value\>OR 함수\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394				0	ko	OR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>최소한 하나 이상의 인수가 TRUE이면 TRUE를 구합니다.\</ahelp\> 모든 인수가 논리값 FALSE를 가지면 FALSE 값을 구합니다				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	ko	인수는 논리 값을 구하는 논리식 자체(TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10)이거나 논리 값을 포함하는 배열 (A1:C3)입니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546				0	ko	함수에 단일 값이 필요하지만 셀 범위를 입력한 경우 수식과 동일한 열 또는 행에 있는 셀 범위의 값을 가져옵니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027				0	ko	입력한 범위가 수식의 현재 열이나 행의 외부에 있으면 이 함수는 오류 값 #VALUE!를 구합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517				0	ko	구문				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	ko	OR(논리값1; 논리값2 ...논리값30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819	24			0	ko	\<emph\>논리값1; 논리값2 ...논리값30\</emph\>는 검사해야 할 값입니다. 모든 값은 TRUE와 FALSE 둘중 한 값을 가집니다. 범위가 매개변수로 입력되었다면, 함수는 현재 행 또는 열 범위 안의 값을 사용합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228				0	ko	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154870				0	ko	12<11; 13>22 및 45=45 항목의 논리 값이 검사됩니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371	27			0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(12<11;13>22;45=45)\</item\>는 TRUE 값을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412	59			0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\>은 TRUE 값을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394K				0	ko	\<bookmark_value\>XOR function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394K				0	ko	XOR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060K				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>Returns the exclusive "or" of arguments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771K				0	ko	The arguments are either numbers, logical expressions themselves (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10) that return logical values, or arrays (A1:C3).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027K				0	ko	If the entered range is outside of the current column or row of the formula, the function returns the error value #VALUE!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517K				0	ko	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468K				0	ko	XOR(Value1; Value2 ...Value30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819K				0	ko	\<emph\>Value1; Value2 ...Value30\</emph\> are added modulo 2. TRUE is returned if the result of this addition is 1;FALSE is returned if the result of this addition is 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228K				0	ko	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371K				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(12<11;13>22;10)\</item\> returns TRUE since this converts to (1+0+10) mod 2 = 0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412K				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\> returns TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
