helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152787				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(-56)\</item\>는 56을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148752				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(12)\</item\>은 12을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id320139				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(0)\</item\>는 0을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
