helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154297				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARCTAN2\"\>지정된 x 및 y 좌표의 역삼각 탄젠트를 구합니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149758				0	ko	구문				20200411 15:09:53
