helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145781				0	ko	\<bookmark_value\>FACT 함수\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>팩토리얼; 숫자\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
