helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154476				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FACT(3)\</item\>는 6을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147525				0	ko	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FACT(0)\</item\>는 1을 반환합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
