helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151174				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TableModeFix\" visibility=\"visible\"\>이 모드가 작동되면 행과 열에서의 변경이 그 옆에만 작용됩니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	ko	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_tablemodefix.png\" id=\"img_id3155903\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155903\"\>아이콘\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
