helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153119				0	ko	예를 들어, 수동 서식을 적용한 단락에서 스타일을 복사해 올 문서를 클릭합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	ko	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> icon and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> from the submenu				20200411 15:09:53
