helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	ko	현재 날짜를 문서를 열 때마다 시간을 업데이트하는 필드로 삽입하거나 업데이트되지 않는 필드로 삽입합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147679				0	ko	\<emph\>삽입 - 필드 - 기타\</emph\>를 선택하고 \<emph\>문서\</emph\> 탭을 클릭합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	ko	Click “Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	ko	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click ”Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154241				0	ko	To insert the date as a field that does not update, click “Date (fixed)” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
