helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3146863				0	ko	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\> and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Document\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153175				0	ko	Click "Chapter" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and "Chapter number and name" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
