helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250				0	ko	\<emph\>확인\</emph\>을 클릭합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3145400				0	ko	하이픈을 넣을 단락에 스타일을 적용합니다.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145417				0	ko	수동 하이픈				20200411 15:09:53
