helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147771				0	ko	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page break\</item\> and then select “Default” from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
