helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155884				0	ko	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"경계선\"\>\<emph\>경계선\</emph\>\</link\> 탭에서 위의 선과 아래 선을 선택하십시오. 두 개의 선을 모두 흰색으로 지정하십시오.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	ko	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Default\</item\> area, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set Top and Bottom Borders Only\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	ko	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line\</item\> area, click a line in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	ko	Select "White" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color\</item\> box. If the background of the page is not white, select the color that best matches the background color.				20200411 15:09:53
