helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3150922				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:TP_FLD_DB:RB_DBOWNFORMAT\"\>선택한 데이터베이스에 지정된 서식을 사용합니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
