helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3147495				0	ko	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_AUTORIGHT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>탭 간격을 오른쪽 페이지 여백에 맞춥니다.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
